  "intro": {
    "title": "Da ist er!",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Da points: Da ist der Bus! (There's the bus!). With sein it means 'present' or 'in': Ist Frau Klein da? (Is Ms Klein in?). It's vaguer than dort, and Germans use it constantly."
    ]
  },
